Ortopedia adulto — Ministério da Saúde and UFRGS (@med-source-ms-ufrgs: 0, is #book, #part-of @medicine-sources) { r_4WDS8TAENAXW3ZGQPZPDBZKA78
Brasil, Ministério da Saúde; Universidade Federal do Rio Grande do Sul, TelessaúdeRS. Ortopedia adulto. Protocolos de encaminhamento da atenção primária para a atenção especializada, volume 4. Brasília, 2022. ISBN 978-65-5993-223-8. Português brasileiro.

[Authorized source](https://bvsms.saude.gov.br/bvs/publicacoes/protocolos_encaminhamento_atencao_ortopedia_adulto.pdf).

Read presentation and introduction, then Protocolo 8 — Dor no Ombro, printed pages 16–17. Other sections support comparison with cervical pain, osteoarthritis, crystal arthritis, bursitis and tendinitis, osteomyelitis, fractures, and dislocations. This is a professional referral protocol from 2022, not a complete current treatment guideline or an instruction to defer urgent assessment.

**Access and reuse:** The edition explicitly states CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 and permits reproduction with source credit. It remains an external link here; any retained or adapted edition must preserve attribution, the noncommercial condition, and share-alike terms. [Licence](https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/).

